  "display_name": "@gpu-bridge/mcp-server",
  "description": "Access **47 AI models** and **30 services** via a single MCP tool.\n\n**Available services:**\n- 🧠 LLM inference (Llama, Qwen, Gemma — sub-second)\n- 🎨 Image generation (FLUX, SD3.5, SDXL)\n- 🎬 Video generation & enhancement (up to 4K)\n- 🎙️ Speech-to-text (Whisper, <1s)\n- 🔊 TTS (40+ voices), music generation, voice cloning\n- 📄 PDF/document parsing, OCR\n- 🔍 Embeddings & reranking (Jina, multilingual)\n- 🛡️ NSFW detection, background removal, face restoration\n\n**Pay-per-use** — USDC via x402 (autonomous agents) or prepaid credits with API key.\n\nGet your free API key at [gpubridge.xyz](https://gpubridge.xyz)",
  "repository_url": "https://mcp-server--gpu-bridge.run.tools",
  "homepage_url": null,
  "license": null,
